{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22006","headline":"赠友五首 二 · 白居易","name":"赠友五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银生楚山曲，金生鄱谿滨。\n南人弃农业，求之多苦辛。\n披砂复凿石，矻矻无冬春。\n手足尽皴胝，爱利不爱身。\n畲田既慵斫，稻田亦嬾耘。\n相携作游手，皆道求金银。\n毕竟金与银，何殊泥与尘。\n且非衣食物，不济饥寒人。\n弃本以趋末，日富而岁贫。\n所以先圣王，弃藏不爲珍。\n谁能反古风，待君秉国钧。\n捐金复抵璧，勿使劳生民。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}